<title>INDIA: Indian December 1996 vehicle production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian December 1996 vehicle production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles rose in December 1996, compared to the same month the previous year, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Thursday.</p>
<p> AUTOMOBILE PRODUCTION &amp; SALES	  (number of units)</p>
<p>   Category			PRODUCTION</p>
<p>		   DEC 96   Dec 95   Apr-Dec 96 Apr-Dec 95</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	28,070   23,975    218,904    184,899</p>
<p>   CARS	  39,224   33,687    294,147    246,011</p>
<p>2-WHEELERS 261,363  228,603  2,257,104  1,934,789  </p>
<p>					  SALES</p>
<p>		   DEC 96   Dec 95   Apr-Dec 96 Apr-Dec 95</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	23,255   22,829    207,304    179,345</p>
<p>   CARS	  35,826   32,547    285,747    241,108</p>
<p>2-WHEELERS 234,424  228,874  2,195,459  1,934,290</p>
<p>-- New Delhi Newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
